{"id":"wb-7-1649","name":"中共太原支部旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"中共太原支部旧址","text":"中共太原支部旧址又名山西省立第一中学旧址，位于中国山西省太原市迎泽区文瀛湖南岸（今文瀛公园内），占地10.3亩，建筑面积5656平方米，现存西式牌坊、大门、部分教室和校长室（丰树堂）等，另在院内新建有三层的主楼。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E5%A4%AA%E5%8E%9F%E6%94%AF%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93252433,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93252433","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b700ebfe823add1a5dea4a55.jpg","title":"Former_No.1_Middle_School_of_Shanxi_Province_01_2012-09.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Former_No.1_Middle_School_of_Shanxi_Province_01_2012-09.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/Former_No.1_Middle_School_of_Shanxi_Province_01_2012-09.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​山西省立第一中学旧址，彭真像及牌坊。","width":320,"height":240}}